title: "BreedingExperiment: Container and Relationship Matrices for Breeding and Quantitative Genomics"
abstract: >-
  A container keeping marker genotypes, phenotypes, pedigree and marker coordinates together, with pedigree, genomic, dominance and single-step relationship matrices computed as methods on it.
